# ──── API Backend ────
# Points to your Express backend (local or deployed)
VITE_API_URL=https://3-6-189-66.sslip.io/api

# ──── Realtime Socket ────
# Socket.io server URL (optional; defaults to VITE_API_URL with /api stripped)
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://3-6-189-66.sslip.io

# ──── Community Chat ────
# No configuration. Community always talks to the real backend
# (GET/POST /api/chat/* plus the socket.io chat namespace).
#
# The VITE_CHAT_MOCK switch and client/src/components/chat/chatMock.js have been
# removed. The mock shipped to production twice - once because an absent
# variable meant "on", and once because a verification grepped for a string the
# mock never contained - and real users saw an invented "Priya Nair" posting
# invented replies. Nothing is left to switch on, so nothing can be misconfigured.
# For fixtures, keep them outside src (scratch branch, Storybook, or a test
# helper) and do not import them from the shipped path.

